EVALUATION.md §10.5, DECISIONS 398, CHK-05: an unknown target of a package subject is E2102, hinted with the nearest let of the test's package and never a test local (`extr` is near the local `extra`); a let of a package that is not imported is unknown too.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

let levels: [Int] = [1]

test "unknown" {
  let extra = 1
  expect package { levls: [2] } passes
  expect package { extr: 1 } passes
  expect package { hidden: 2 } passes
}
-- b/b.canon --
package b

/// Hidden.
let hidden: Int = 1
-- findings.txt --
error[E2102]  a/a.canon:7:20
  unknown name levls (did you mean levels?)

error[E2102]  a/a.canon:8:20
  unknown name extr

error[E2102]  a/a.canon:9:20
  unknown name hidden

3 errors, 0 warnings in 2 packages (…)
